  "goodToKnow": "Der Sparer (die Sparerin) is a saver. Germans are known for a strong saving culture, traditionally with das Sparbuch, though ETFs have become popular. The Sparerpauschbetrag lets individuals earn 1,000 euros a year in investment income tax-free (2,000 for couples) since 2023; you set it up with a Freistellungsauftrag at your bank. The plural is the same: die Sparer."
